{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8a66dea6ef1723a8","name":"Juggernaut War Droid","source":{"id":"source:reference-8a66dea6ef1723a8","title":"Juggernaut War Droid","revision":25931,"timestamp":"2025-01-05T04:08:26Z","sha256":"1e519bdcf918a054db0c03afd9a387c6175299565a8842540c74c63248e8b6f2","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=25931","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Juggernaut%20War%20Droid&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8a66dea6ef1723a8","blocks":["\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["Juggernaut War Droid Units\n",{"tag":"p","children":["\n"]},"\n"],"colspan":2}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Juggernaut War Droid Squad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Juggernaut_War_Droid_Squad","referenceId":"reference:85118f4014ed774d"},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["\n\n"]},"\n"],"colspan":2}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Juggernaut War Droid Battalion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Juggernaut_War_Droid_Battalion","referenceId":"reference:eb4d1307e0ce77c5"},"\n"],"colspan":2}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Republic Rocket-Jumpers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Republic_Rocket-Jumpers","referenceId":"reference:8bea0d50138845e5"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Juggernaut War Droid by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Duwani Mechanical Products"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Duwani_Mechanical_Products","referenceId":"reference:41885578ac879bdf"}," is designed specifically for use by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Republic Rocket-Jumpers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Republic_Rocket-Jumpers","referenceId":"reference:8bea0d50138845e5"},". Intended for use as a remote resupply and combat assistance Droid, the Juggernaut War Droid is a valuable aid to the Rocket-Jumpers, whose far-ranging missions carry them outside the normal military supply lines. During ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Great Sith War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Great_Sith_War"},", Juggernaut War Droids provide Republic soldiers with much-needed material, and thanks to the versatility of their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jet Packs"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jet_Packs"},", which also serve as underwater propulsion systems, these Droids are able to reach Republic personnel well behind enemy lines.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Juggernaut War Droid is equipped with a Shatter Beam (designed to penetrate enemy bunkers and other defensive positions) as well as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Sonic Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Sonic_Pistol","referenceId":"reference:6d1cfcfc6c6f3bc5"}," to protect the Droid from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},"-wielding foes. However, the Droid's primary weapon is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pulse-Wave Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pulse-Wave_Rifle","referenceId":"reference:a0dea96aa3ef2f50"},"; the other weapons are to be used only in emergency situations. Many of these Droids are retired after taking part in a Droid uprising on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Coruscant"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Coruscant","referenceId":"reference:2ee37a21e9e7a955"}," during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Great Sith War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Great_Sith_War"},", having been reprogrammed by the original ",{"tag":"a","children":["HK-01"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/HK-01?action=edit&redlink=1"}," prototype.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Juggernaut War Droids can't be played as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Heroes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Heroes"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Juggernaut War Droid Statistics (CL 4)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["4th-Degree Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/4th-Degree_Droid"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 6/",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldier","referenceId":"reference:f826baa05bef6921"}," 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +12; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Binary"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Binary","referenceId":"reference:ee1c8277caf5fb9b"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 20 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 17), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 16, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},": 14\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","child